NOTE ON CLINICAL CONTENT

This software is a demonstration of healthcare interoperability engineering.
It is NOT a medical device, NOT clinically validated, and MUST NOT be used in
patient care.

All data is synthetic. No protected health information (PHI) is used or
included.

SNOMED CT is licensed content owned by SNOMED International, available in
member territories via a UMLS licence. LOINC is used under the LOINC licence.
Codes appear here only as identifiers for interoperability demonstration.
Bindings marked PROVISIONAL in terminology.py are developer-asserted and have
NOT been validated against an authoritative terminology release.
